<title>USA: ValuJet offers spring fare sale.</title>
<headline>ValuJet offers spring fare sale.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>ValuJet Airlines said Wednesday it is offering a spring fare sale for travel throughout its entire route system.</p>
<p>The company said the sale provides savings of up to 50 percent on seven-day advance purchase fares for travel through May 22 and from May 27 through May 31.</p>
<p>Travelers must buy fares at least three days before travel and no later than April 27, the company said.</p>
